SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox 2028 · 秋分
DESCRIPTION:The sun crosses the equator again, heading south.\n\nFrom here, northern nights grow longer until winter solstice.\n\nhttps://pilgrimapp.org/sunpath/2028-autumn-equinox
